@startuml
' https://plantuml.com/class-diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide methods
left to right direction

package "Returns & Quarantine Management" {

    class Return {
        +returnId
        +SKU
        +qty
        +reason        ' CustomerRemorse | Damaged | Expired | CycleCount
        +timestamp
        +expiryDate
    }

    class Quarantine {
        +queue
        +addReturn()
        +inspectReturn()
    }

    class InspectionLog {
        +timestamp
        +returnId
        +sku
        +action        ' Restocked | Discarded
        +qty
        +qtyRestocked
        +qtyDiscarded
    }

    class SKU {
        +skuCode
        +name
        +category
        +unit
        +volume
        +unitWeight
    }

    class Box {
        +boxId
        +sku
        +qty
        +expiryDate
        +receivedAt
        +aisle
        +bay
    }

    class Warehouse {
        +warehouseId
        +aisles
    }

    class QualityOperator {
        +processReturns()
    }

    class WMS {
        +recordReturnInspection()
        +restockBox()
    }
}

' --- Relationships ---
QualityOperator "1" --> "1" Quarantine : manages >
Quarantine "1" --> "0..*" Return : contains >
Return "*" --> "1" SKU : refers to >
QualityOperator "1" --> "1" WMS : uses >
WMS "1" --> "1..*" Warehouse : manages >
WMS "1" --> "0..*" InspectionLog : records >
WMS "1" --> "0..*" Box : creates new restock boxes >

' --- Behavioral notes ---
note right of Quarantine
Inspection order:
latest first (timestamp DESC),
tie-break: returnId ASC
end note

note bottom of Return
If reason = Damaged or Expired → Discarded
If reason = CustomerRemorse or CycleCount → Restocked
Restock as new Box:
boxId = "RET-" + returnId
receivedAt = now()
expiryDate = provided or null
Inserted using FEFO/FIFO rules (see USEI01)
end note

note right of InspectionLog
Audit file entry example:
2025-09-22 14:32 | returnId=R105 | sku=SKU123 | action=Restocked | qty=8
end note

@enduml


